OL,3,GNEWSAReform MP says her children begged
OL,4,Aher to quit politics over safety fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Reform UK politician said her
OL,7,Fchildren had begged her to quit
OL,8,Fpolitics because they fear for her
OL,9,Fsafety.
OL,11,FSarah Pochin, the MP for Runcorn and
OL,12,FHelsby, said all eight of the party's
OL,13,FMPs now had 24-hour security.
OL,15,FShe said security had been stepped up
OL,16,Fsince the death of Ann Widdecombe, the
OL,17,Fformer Tory minister who was an
OL,18,Fimmigration and justice spokeswoman for
OL,19,FReform when she was killed at her home
OL,20,Fin July.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
